        "quote": "The Personnel Division shall keep and preserve in a permanent form a full record of all proceedings pertaining to all police and fire employees for the full duration of employment and a minimum of three years after termination of employment. The Chief of the Fire Department and Police Department shall be responsible for ensuring that these records are forwarded immediately to the Personnel Division upon their creation. (Ord. 20206 §§ 28, 86, 9-10-19.)",
